    "title": {
      "en": "Weekly Bonus Rolls Now Available",
      "es": "Ya están disponibles las tiradas de bonificación semanales"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Weekly Bonus Rolls Now Available...",
      "es": "Ya están disponibles las tiradas de bonificación semanales..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac5614dc2b6d7.45177251\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">With the weekly reset, weekly bonus rolls are now available in Silvermoon!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/bonus-rolls-item-upgrades\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Bonus Loot Rolls &amp; Ascendant Venomstones</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_1205_voidforge_fluctuatingvoidcores_green.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>To unlock Weekly Rolls, players must complete <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97945/in-the-catalysts-shadow\"><img alt=\"In the Catalyst's Shadow\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">In the Catalyst's Shadow</span></a> and <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97978/prismatic-potential\"><img alt=\"Prismatic Potential\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Prismatic Potential</span></a>. These quests were available <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/start-the-season-2-bonus-roll-questline-this-week-382515\" data-contiguous=\"true\">when Season 2 began</a>, so you may have already completed them. If you haven't, head to Decimus in the Voidstorm to start the questline. <br><br>After turning in Prismatic Potential, players can earn <b>one</b> bonus roll per week at <b>Orin in Silvermoon</b>. The cost of the bonus roll is:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">5,000 Gold</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">2,000 Voidlight Marl</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">100 Veteran Crests</div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304932.jpg\" id=\"1304932\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304932.jpg?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.684533 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Good luck on your Bonus Rolls!</div>\n            \n            <noscript>With the weekly reset, weekly bonus rolls are now available in Silvermoon!<br /><br />Bonus Loot Rolls &amp; Ascendant Venomstones<br /><br />To unlock Weekly Rolls, players must complete <a href=\"/quest=97945/in-the-catalysts-shadow\">In the Catalyst's Shadow</a> and <a href=\"/quest=97978/prismatic-potential\">Prismatic Potential</a>. These quests were available <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/start-the-season-2-bonus-roll-questline-this-week-382515\">when Season 2 began</a>, so you may have already completed them. If you haven't, head to Decimus in the Voidstorm to start the questline. <br /><br />After turning in Prismatic Potential, players can earn <b>one</b> bonus roll per week at <b>Orin in Silvermoon</b>. The cost of the bonus roll is:<br /><ul><li>5,000 Gold</li><li>2,000 Voidlight Marl</li><li>100 Veteran Crests</li></ul><br /><br />Good luck on your Bonus Rolls!</noscript>            \n        ",
